<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>In my Christian life I’d daily fall,</l><l>So I answered every altar-call,</l><l>Till I left the altar, left it all,</l><l>To touch the throne.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Brothers, to the Holiest forward come;</l><l>Leave your sins behind, the race now run.</l><l>Hallelujah! All the work is done—</l><l>The veil is gone!</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Now within the veil, enjoying God,</l><l>Manna, law of life, and budding rod;</l><l>Christ Himself, the ark, is our abode—</l><l>Hallelujah!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
